[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753188\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752727\">3330B26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752725\">3330B22</a></p><p>1. Undo the nuts securing the pedal unit to the body and and brake\nservo.</p><p>2. Remove the pedal mount from its seat.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046672.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the pedal mount in its\nseat.</p><p>Tighten the nuts securing the pedal to\nthe brake servo and body to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>PEDAL MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752725\">3330B22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752727\">3330B26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753188\">7040A37</a></p>"]]